{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "114058a46bcc04758078ce5a315b87ade4459504423413d302bfcb1e83b82032", "ja": "（世間はハロウィン一色。劇場でも、アイドル達が\nお菓子を配ったりもらったり、楽しそうだ……）", "zh": "（外面到处都是万圣节的气氛。剧场里，偶像们也在开心地分发、收取糖果……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "5585236619867a1889e4a13f646060cc62fce183111bffa6491032a0f6fcde18", "ja": "あの……{$P$}。\n今、ちょっとだけお時間いいですか？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}。\n现在能耽误您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f84334755d3930c2d37bf6f30986ae9c70838d074c935983a9548d926e192ad5", "ja": "ああ、琴葉。お疲れさま。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "啊，是琴叶。辛苦了。\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "284e8f14467fd03010cf6eee0a834d4f46c5b0e48c9f5c651f40c62d77f35720", "ja": "その……えっと……。いきなりですけど、\nトリック・オア・トリートって言ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "那个……嗯……虽然有点突然，能请你说一句“不给糖就捣蛋”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b5efc44a75edb3fc47904421d8c15f3eaebedd461644f134519b5ff56553c148", "ja": "え？　じゃあ……\nトリック・オア・トリート。", "zh": "咦？那就……\n不给糖就捣蛋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2000_017kth", "source_sha256": "085b992c42cb07b8b9112d00ad10cdeaac779c561fbf029bac1d7dd056ec21d6", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　では、受け取ってください。\n{$P$}用のスイーツです。", "zh": "谢谢您！那么，请收下吧。\n这是给{$P$}的点心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2013", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2001_017kth", "source_sha256": "3b55e7d6a89385c8b57d55f0993b007a7d01acc0293ab74772c9aebf0cdfb7a6", "ja": "ハロウィンの気分を、\n{$P$}にも味わってほしくて。", "zh": "想让{$P$}也感受一下万圣节的气氛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2002_p", "source_sha256": "9b1fe481d186d91d2cefd25580b30d60ff866a88694a9137bffdee75236dfe40", "ja": "それで……。ありがとう、琴葉。\nこのスイーツも、とても美味しそうだな。", "zh": "所以……谢谢你，琴叶。\n这些甜点看起来也非常美味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2003_017kth", "source_sha256": "f903ae32f4b37bc7d80777d9cc7eb8d32897b037305017b3b87f4e77aa7b017b", "ja": "本当ですか？　よかった……。\n実は、選ぶ時にすごく迷ったんです。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了……\n其实我挑选的时候纠结了好久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2004_017kth", "source_sha256": "02b4262a22791831d4956b383473d7dd210a032d10157779169416bbe270440e", "ja": "ハロウィンパーティーで見た\nガラスの靴のデザートが、とても綺麗で……。", "zh": "万圣节派对上看到的\n玻璃鞋甜点，真的很漂亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2005_017kth", "source_sha256": "a0c13b9e8dff46705a793aab9585ac1cc3241c017a3cb6161dca1e93c7908d1e", "ja": "どうしてもスイーツのハードルが上がってしまって。\n私が「いいな」と思ったのを選んじゃいました。", "zh": "不知不觉就提高了对甜点的要求。\n我选了自己觉得“不错”的那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2006_p", "source_sha256": "6e3d7be8f97e55044286a5119354379badafbf846b03c07e0492aa182d05e28a", "ja": "確かにあのデザートは綺麗だったけど、関係ないよ。\n琴葉が選んでくれたんだ。大事に食べるよ。", "zh": "那道甜点确实很漂亮，不过这不重要。\n是琴叶帮我选的，我会好好享用的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2007_017kth", "source_sha256": "f28ab20ddd9acbaf696ef71d9cd8aa9084ba92d2a95794f82f288eb560e6d65d", "ja": "そう言ってもらえると、私も嬉しいです。\n……やっぱり{$P$}は、優しいな。", "zh": "听你这么说，我也很开心。\n……果然，{$P$}很温柔呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2008_p", "source_sha256": "c685f0051df38bfb001b45b3ec1df7bba49e36b7a44e43fbe875c366e9a1e806", "ja": "そうだ。もし琴葉が食べてないなら、\nスイーツ、半分ずつ食べないか？", "zh": "对了。要是琴叶还没吃的话，要不要把甜点分着吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2009_017kth", "source_sha256": "889038144528f39849bc0eb958b0334b8e61e961d449199cf00c726c1a46c8a4", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか？　あ、でも……。\nそれは、{$P$}のためので……。", "zh": "诶，可以吗？　啊，不过……\n那个，是给{$P$}准备的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2010_p", "source_sha256": "13ecc3472557f105804fb9b60d4ed441b78d643183ca9d4edbebf1a91e395a17", "ja": "あ、忙しいなら大丈夫だ！　ただ誰かと一緒に\n食べた方が、ハロウィンを楽しめるかと思っただけで。", "zh": "啊，你要是忙的话就不用勉强了！我只是想着，和别人一起吃的话，或许能更开心地享受万圣节。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2011_017kth", "source_sha256": "22b027ba82361877a10db076600f3839ef9920fca210cceb36827453afe305f5", "ja": "一緒に……。そうですね！　なら、お言葉に甘えて。\nどんな味がするか楽しみです……ふふっ♪", "zh": "一起……嗯，说得也是！那我就恭敬不如从命了。真期待会是什么味道……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0343_2012_p", "source_sha256": "479e0a1b7f2818d006162943f295828375a714b8c0dcdae1ae0977023e4c562d", "ja": "（スイーツの美味しさに、思わず琴葉と一緒に\n笑顔になった。……とても良いハロウィンだな！）", "zh": "甜点的美味让人不由得和琴叶一起露出了笑容。……真是个非常棒的万圣节啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
